---
import Anagram from '../Anagram.astro';
---

<section
  id="about"
  aria-labelledby="about-title"
  class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-12 gap-y-8 border-t-2 border-ink pt-16 pb-16"
>
  <h2 id="about-title" class="heading-2 flex-[1_1_280px]">
    One maker, many benches
  </h2>
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-[2_1_420px] flex-col gap-6">
    <p class="max-w-[40rem] text-[19px] leading-relaxed text-soft">
      By day I look after computers, servers and web apps at the Ministry of Culture, and build the
      tools my colleagues are missing. By night I build the things I wish existed. The ones that
      turn out useful end up on this page.
    </p>
    <aside
      class="on-dark flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-card bg-ink px-7 py-6 text-paper"
      aria-label="Easter egg"
    >
      <p class="font-mono text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-accent uppercase">Easter egg</p>
      <Anagram from="Simone Lazzari" to="Simon Realizza" />
      <p class="text-lg leading-normal">
        Shuffle the letters of <strong>Simone Lazzari</strong> and you get{' '}
        <strong>Simon Realizza</strong>. In Italian, <em>realizza</em> means “makes it real”.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
